    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000sgrt](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000sgrt) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 11.634 depth occurred on Mar 17 2026 40km SE of Imías. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 19.8399 longitude -74.3586. It impacted 51102 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
